WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:04.600
Bissell's Big Green
deep cleaning machine

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.550
is quick and easy to use.

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:09.730
Start by vacuuming
the entire area.

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:12.040
Remove the dirty water
tank from the top

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:15.370
and lift the clean water tank
from the base of the machine.

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:18.590
Take the clean water
tank to your sink.

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:21.230
Now fill with hot tap
water to the water line

00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:23.300
that's indicated on the tank.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:26.460
Add two capsules of
Bissell's solution.

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:28.430
You've got plenty
of solution choices

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:30.750
to fit your cleaning needs.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:34.130
Next, replace the tanks,
making sure the dirty water

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:37.610
tank is properly seated on
top of a clean water tank.

00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:40.190
And you're ready to clean.

00:00:40.190 --> 00:00:43.580
Start the machine and
recline the handle.

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:46.760
Press the trigger and
make one slow forward

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:50.560
and backward pass over the area.

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:54.250
Release the trigger and make one
slow forward and backward pass

00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:57.490
over the same area to suction
up additional dirty water

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:59.020
from the carpet.

00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:02.600
Avoid oversaturating the area.

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:04.400
The flow indicator
on the machine

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:06.590
stops spinning to
let you know when you

00:01:06.590 --> 00:01:09.240
need more water and solution.

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:11.790
Empty the dirty water
tank into the sink

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:14.850
and refill the clean water
tank with additional water

00:01:14.850 --> 00:01:17.460
and solution as necessary.

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:19.740
When you are completely
finished cleaning,

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:22.890
make sure to empty and rinse
both the clean and dirty water

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:25.680
tanks and return back
onto the machine.

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:28.110
Check the brush roll and
the bottom of the machine

00:01:28.110 --> 00:01:29.820
for dirt and debris.

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:32.100
Quick, easy, and you're done.

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:35.720
Bissell's Big Green
deep cleaning machine.

